 "69de4f212ee0e063d9240277", "type": "singleCorrect", "chapters": ["60c9e849ea076dc381c0df7c"], "topics": ["60e2fada66f9ce3f243b476a"], "concepts": ["60e2fb9d66f9ce3f243b52b2"], "question": {"text": "The ranges and heights for two projectiles projected with the same initial velocity at angles <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>42</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>48</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> with the horizontal are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> respectively. Choose the correct option:"}, "options": [{"id": "fb03a2", "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f212ee0e063d9240278"}, {"id": "b60094", "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f212ee0e063d9240279"}, {"id": "97db7c", "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f212ee0e063d924027a"}, {"id": "01eb40", "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/M