60e2fbdb66f9ce3f243b5642"], "question": {"text": "A plane is inclined at an angle <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> with respect to the horizontal. A particle is projected with a speed <math><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> , from the base of the plane, making an angle <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> with respect to the plane as shown in the figure. The distance from the base, at which the particle hits the plane is close to:<br />(Take <math><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> )<br /><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/quantrexacademy-app.firebasestorage.app/o/questions%2Ffigs%2Fpyq%2Fjee_main%2F14b914f6-7d05-4a47-8ec6-3d5e842cc7e0-image.png?alt=media\" style=\"width: 310px; height: 222px;\" />"}, "options": [{"id": "7df33e", "text": "<math><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f212ee0e063d9240282"}, {"id": "0cfeba", "text": "<math><mn>18</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f212ee0e063d9240283"}, {"id": "544a0e", "text": "<math><mn>14</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f212ee0e063d9240284"}, {"id": "f9e962", "text": "<math><mn>26</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f212ee0e063d9240285"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f212ee0e063d9240286", "type": "singleCorrect", "chapters": ["60c9e849ea076dc381c0df7c"], "topics": ["60e567de499d1e49588f9cd4"], "concepts": ["60e567dc499d1e49588f9ca9"], "question": {"text": "A boy ties a stone of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> to the end of a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> long string and whirls it around in a horizontal plane. The string can withstand the maximum tension of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>80</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>. If the maximum speed with which the stone can revolve is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>K</mi><mi>&#960;</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>rev</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>min</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi></math> is :<br />(Assume the string is massless and un-stretchable)"}, "options": [{"id": "a24d76", "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>400</mn></math>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f212ee0e063d9240287"}, {"id": "db7d12", "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>300</mn></math>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f212ee0e063d9240288"}, {"id": "938d38", "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>600</mn></math>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f212ee0e063d9240289"}, {"id": "b660e4", "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>800</mn></math>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f212ee0e063d924028a"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f212ee0e063d924028b", "type": "sing